lot max); remove the refused Grok max and the duplicated constants'\n49:       done: false\n50:     - task: \"P10 (HvStorageSchema, before any HV entity): stored backslash workspace keys rewritten by the rekey maintenance command with its startup guard, under the federation plan's D5 and D7, through FR-MCP-PATHNORM-001 imported into this store, with a named test\"\n51:       done: false\n52:     - task: \"P11 (H1, before FR-MCP-HVPIPE-008-AC010 is bound): the stop hook's stale-cache proof readable (a result type the REPL awaits and the fields the hook reads), to the foundation's stop gate, through FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-004, with a named test, synced to every plugin that carries the core\"\n53:       done: false\n54:     - task: \"P12 (HvStorageSchema): a root-relative Windows segment resolved against the root's drive in Combine, through FR-MCP-PATHNORM-001, with a named test\"\n55:       done: false\n56:     - task: 'P13 (HvStorageSchema): legacy GitHub token entries readable, updated, and deleted after the token-store key rewrite of the rekey command (federation P1.5), with a named test'\n57:       done: false\n58:     - task: 'P14 (H1): descendants killed after the root exits (FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-004 acceptance criterion 1), with a named test, synced to every plugin that carries the core'\n59:       done: false\n60:     - task: \"P15 (H1, before FR-MCP-HVPIPE-008-AC010 is bound): a consumed stop override no longer lets an in-progress turn pass the Stop gate, and the gate never closes a turn (the foundation's FR-MCP-SESSIONTURN-005), through FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-005, with a named test, synced to every plugin that carries the core\"\n61:       done: false\n62:     dependsOn: *o0\n63:     functionalRequirements:\n64:     - FR-MCP-HOSTILEREVIEW-002\n65:     - FR-MCP-HOSTILEREVIEW-003\n66:     - FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-004\n67:     - FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-005\n68:     technicalRequirements:\n69:     - TR-MCP-DB-004\n70:     - TR-MCP-HOSTILEREVIEW-003\n71:     - TR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-00