l, when its launch is built, then the effort is the highest its CLI accepts (Codex `max`, Claude `max`, Cline `xhigh`, Grok `xhigh`, Copilot `max`; VI-08), never a lower or a refused value, and the model is the CLI default recorded from provenance (`ReviewerAdapterDefaultsToHighestEffortAndCliDefaultModel`).\",\n      \"isSatisfied\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"AC004\",\n      \"text\": \"Given an update with a stale `expectedStateVersion`, when it is applied, then 409 `conflict` with `retryable: false` and `details.field` `expectedStateVersion` and nothing changes (`UpdateReviewerStaleStateVersion409NothingChanged`).\",\n      \"isSatisfied\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"AC005\",\n      \"text\": \"Given an update that changes the strategy, agent path, model, or effort, when it commits, then the reviewer is `Unverified` with reason `configuration_changed` and `reviewer_unverified` is appended (`UpdateReviewerLaunchChangeMakesUnverifiedAndNotifies`).\",\n      \"isSatisfied\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"AC006\",\n      \"text\": \"Given the REST, MCP, client, REPL, and Director surfaces, when each lists, gets, and updates a reviewer, then each returns the same record and the same error codes (`ReviewerSurfacesParityGoldenContract`).\",\n      \"isSatisfied\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"description\": \"Reviewer pool configuration and real-time management. Sources: S-02, R-08. Use cases: UC-HV-01.\",\n  \"id\": \"FR-MCP-HVPIPE-001\",\n  \"title\": \"Reviewer pool configuration and real-time management\",\n  \"area\": \"MCP\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-17T14:25:08.8543231+00:00\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-17T14:25:08.8543604+00:00\",\n  \"scopeStartLayerKey\": \"layer-1\"\n}\n{\"Kind\":\"Tr\",\"TotalReceived\":463,\"Selected\":21,\"Ids\":[\"TR-MCP-HVPIPE-001\",\"TR-MCP-HVPIPE-002\",\"TR-MCP-HVPIPE-003\",\"TR-MCP-HVPIPE-004\",\"TR-MCP-HVPIPE-005\",\"TR-MCP-HVPIPE-006\",\"TR-MCP-HVPIPE-007\",\"TR-MCP-HVPIPE-008\",\"TR-MCP-HVPIPE-009\",\