trengthens the acceptance criteria P10 to P15 are fixed through.\",\n    \"- D-08 settled: hvr-, hvprobe-, and hvi- keep the UTC yyyyMMddTHHmmssZ\",\n    \"  stamp; every stored timestamp is UTC with offset; local time is for\",\n    \"  display only (section 12 cites it).\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Lint PASSED at 2026-10-17T09:15:49 local (114 acceptance criteria, 15\",\n    \"problems, 8 decisions). Status: proposed, not approved, not\",\n    \"hostile-validated.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Signed: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh@ClaudeCode | Confidence: correctness 95%, accuracy 96%, completeness 94%\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\n    \"Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QPEG9wEPfbfj4qgB3eeK2N\",\n    \"\\u0000\",\n    \"0a449314528c5bfc07e9b386c97034716e2ddbd4\\u0000docs(architecture): amendment 1, turns already HV-reviewed migrate Final (AC007)\",\n    \"\",\n    \"What-if per requirement before the hostile validation (profile 7.5,\",\n    \"legacy and upgrade): the freeze keys on HvState only, so a turn that\",\n    \"already holds a Pass or Fail hostile review when A-11 adds the column\",\n    \"would start None, stay writable, and could be admitted again, against\",\n    \"S-07 (\\\"Session log may not allow updates to a turn with an HV review\\\")\",\n    \"and S-20. Such turns exist if the foundation's Phase B ships its manual\",\n    \"hostile reviews before A-06 retires them.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"- A-11: the migration that adds HvState and HvRequestId sets Final (with\",\n    \"  no request id) on every turn whose hostile review is Pass or Fail.\",\n    \"- Section 7.4 and section 12 state it; HvAdmissionEligibility names the\",\n    \"  null request id of such a turn; HvStorageSchema owns the rule.\",\n    \"- FR-MCP-HVPIPE-012-AC007 (MigrationMarksHvReviewedTurnsFinalThreeProviders,\",\n    \"  three providers); 19.2 maps S-07 to it. FR, TR, and TEST-MCP-HVPIPE-012\",\n    \"  updated in the store in one atomic updateBatch; all 63 records equal\",\n    \"  section 19.1 (2026-10-17T08:55:01 local).\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Lint PASSED at 2026-10-17T08:54:21 local (114 acceptance criteria).\",\n    \"Status: proposed, not approved, not hostile-validated.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Signed: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh@ClaudeCode | Confidence: correctness 94%, accuracy 95%, completeness 94%\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\n    \"Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QPEG9wEPfbfj4qgB3eeK2N\",\n    \"\\u0000\",\n    \"31904493381cfef56c57790950e23e72f3ecc39b\\u0000docs(architecture): amendment 1, pre-HV holistic review fixes and AC011\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Holistic read of the whole amendment before the hostile validation (profile\",\n    \"7.5), with what-if and propagation checks. Implementer fixes:\",\n    \"\",\n    \"- A-02 cited section 20.4 for the rule that the pipeline does not validate\",\n    \"  its own plan; the rule is in section 20.3.\",\n    \"- Section 7.3 still read \\\"not the submitter\\\" after D-05; eligibility now\",\n    \"  names the author too, as R-08, I-07, and HvReviewerEligibility do.\",\n    \"- I-06 described the log hash as the SHA-256 of the concatenation, while\",\n    \"  section 12 and V-1 use the chain hash over the chunks' SHA-256 values;\",\n    \"  I-06 now states the chain hash, and section 12 no longer cites R-12 for\",\n    \"  a definition R-12 does not hold.\",\n    \"- GetHvEvidenceQuery listed a runId of another request as 400 while its\",\n    \"  diagram and sequence 17.10 answer 404 not_found run; the list now says 404.\",\n    \"- HvIncident.DedupeKey and R-17 named only the reviewer form; both now name\",\n    \"  hv-server-<failureCode>, which FailHvRunCommand, the lease sweep, and\",\n    \"  FR-MCP-HVPIPE-009-AC006 already use.\",\n    \"- Section 13.3 called hv_probe the only record of a probe brief, while\",\n    \"  ReadinessProbeVerdict also reads hv_reviewer_turn; the probe brief now\",\n    \"  asks for both.\",\n    \"- HvWorkerHost \\\"dispatches only internal units\\\" contradicted its startup\",\n    \"  StartHvReviewerNonceCommand; it is now the only dispatcher of the\",\n    \"  internal units.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"New acceptance criterion from the what-if pass (a sibling of P14 in the HV\",\n    \"design, and a deadlock of P-02 with read-to-end output): killing a reviewer\",\n    \"ends its whole process tree, also after the root exited, and a descendant\",\n    \"holding the output pipes is ended so the run cannot be held open forever\",\n    \"(section 16.2; FR-MCP-HVPIPE-008-AC011, ReviewerStopEndsWholeProcessTree,\",\n    \"H3; 19.2 maps P-02 to it). FR, TR, and TEST-MCP-HVPIPE-008 were updated in\",\n    \"the store in one atomic updateBatch; all 63 records equal section 19.1\",\n    \"(Test-HvpipeStoreEquality, 2026-10-17T08:48:33 local, 63 of 63).\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Checks: lint PASSED at 2026-10-17T08:45:03 local (113 acceptance criteria,\",\n    \"15 problems, 7 decisions); foundation SHA-256 at 36783b79 equals the\",\n    \"claimed 6E5D4F41...295E; 0 of 94 Mermaid blocks changed since 6dbc3843.\",\n    \"Status: proposed, not approved, not hostile-validated.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Signed: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh@ClaudeCode | Confidence: correctness 95%, accuracy 95%, completeness 94%\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\n    \"Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QPEG9wEPfbfj4qgB3eeK2N\",\n    \"\\u0000\",\n    \"f5fd5ab24ad00b09053daf07ed3c0d850f70498d\\u0000docs(architecture): amendment 1, P15 names a plan-created requirement as such\",\n    \"\",\n    \"P15 cited FR-MCP-SESSIONTURN-005 as if it were a stored requirement. A\",\n    \"requirement read at 2026-10-17T08:36:10 local answered not_found: it is\",\n    \"created by PLAN-SESSIONTURNREVIEW-001 (slice A7) and the store does not\",\n    \"hold it yet. P15 now says so, and quotes that plan's change to\",\n    \"TR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-005 (\\\"Close-PluginTurnIfNeeded blocks instead of\",\n    \"closing\\\"), which is a stored record.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Lint PASSED at 2026-10-17T08:36:32 local.\",\n    \"Status: proposed, not approved, not hostile-validated.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Signed: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh@ClaudeCode | Confidence: correctness 97%, accuracy 97%, completeness 95%\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\n    \"Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QPEG9wEPfbfj4qgB3eeK2N\",\n    \"\\u0000\",\n    \"bd6e37b33f043b1ede3a1feeaf7073d357ea21cf\\u0000docs(architecture): amendment 1, PR 81 findings P10 to P15 and D-04 settled\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Operator, 2026-10-17: \\\"1. Yes, 2. A\\\".\",\n    \"\",\n    \"1. Yes: the six findings of the Codex review of PR 81 (review 5554472359 on\",\n    \"   6dbc384323, posted 2026-10-16T17:48:12 local, after the merge) are\",\n    \"   registered as P10 to P15 in section 21, each checked against this\",\n    \"   branch's source:\",\n    \"   - P10 legacy workspace keys are not rewritten (WorkspaceKeyConversion\",\n    \"     reads stored values unchanged; no migration or other code rewrites\",\n    \"     them). This is the federation plan's undelivered P1.5 (rekey command,\",\n    \"     startup guard, token-store rewrite; its D5 and D7). Codex's suggested\",\n    \"     migration contradicts D5.\",\n    \"   - P11 the stop hook's stale-cache proof cannot be read\",\n    \"     (Task<UnifiedSessionLogDto> is not awaited by the REPL passthrough,\",\n    \"     and the DTO lacks the proof fields).\",\n    \"   - P12 a root-relative Windows segment is not treated as rooted.\",\n    \"   - P13 legacy GitHub token entries are not normalized on read (the\",\n    \"     federation plan's P1.5 includes this rewrite).\",\n    \"   - P14 Stop-ReplChildTree kills the tree only while the root runs\",\n    \"     (FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-004 acceptance criterion 1).\",\n    \"   - P15 a consumed stop override returns before the turn is handled.\",\n    \"     Codex's suggested fix (continue to completion) contradicts the\",\n    \"     approved foundation (FR-MCP-SESSIONTURN-005: the stop gate never\",\n    \"     closes a turn).\",\n    \"   Section 20.4 adds two entry conditions: no HV entity before P10, P12,\",\n    \"   and P13 are closed; FR-MCP-HVPIPE-008-AC010 bound to the real hosts only\",\n    \"   after P11, P14, and P15 are closed. Who fixes them is the new open\",\n    \"   decision D-07 (owning plans, or this plan).\",\n    \"2. A: D-04 settled, the HV reviewer of this amendment and its plan is\",\n    \"   Codex gpt-6-astra at effort max.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Lint PASSED at 2026-10-17T08:35:07 local (15 problems, 7 decisions, 112\",\n    \"acceptance criteria, each with a test name; no dashes, no tables).\",\n    \"Status: proposed, not approved, not hostile-validated.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Signed: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh@ClaudeCode | Confidence: correctness 95%, accuracy 95%, completeness 93%\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\n    \"Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QPEG9wEPfbfj4qgB3eeK2N\",\n    \"\\u0000\",\n    \"6dbc384323c036a57c37fd9eaf2259879c1d956f\\u0000docs(architecture): amendment 1, decisions settled from operator instructions\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Operator: \\\"The 10 questions, please look at the totality of the project, of\",\n    \"all of my instructions, and see if you can solve them yourself.\\\" Settled from\",\n    \"those instructions, with sources in section 22:\",\n    \"\",\n    \"- D-01: reviewer exclusion is by agent family, not model vendor (S-17, P-01,\",\n    \"  and the operator's own configuration running Cline on gpt-6-astra beside\",\n    \"  Codex as two reviewers).\",\n    \"- D-02: the HostileReview subsystem stays separate (it reviews artifacts,\",\n    \"  FR-MCP-HOSTILEREVIEW-002; this pipeline reviews turns, S-03); its missing\",\n    \"  worker reuses HvWorkerHost and the reviewer adapters; P1 to P3 land in H3.\",\n    \"- D-05: the author of the reviewed turns is excluded as well as the submitter\",\n    \"  (S-28, new standing rule P-07 \\\"Self-check alone is not validation.\\\"):\",\n    \"  AuthorReviewerId on HvRequest, HvReviewerEligibility, RoundRobinAssignment,\",\n    \"  V-5, I-07, R-08, R-09, L-01, A-09, UC-HV-03; new FR-MCP-HVPIPE-002-AC008;\",\n    \"  AC004 and AC006 made precise under the new exclusion.\",\n    \"- D-06: Cline stays unqualified until it records a run's effort (P-04 fails\",\n    \"  closed).\",\n    \"- Live logging probe: verified in H1 on a separate instance, never the live\",\n    \"  server (operator rule for integration checks).\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Still the operator's: D-03 (approval of A-01 to A-12 and the plan) and D-04\",\n    \"(the HV reviewer: \\\"If not specified by operator, ask what agent and model to\",\n    \"use for HV in a session.\\\").\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Requirements captured as they emerge (requirements skill: \\\"Capture\",\n    \"requirements as they emerge; do not defer to end of session.\\\"): the 63\",\n    \"records FR, TR, TEST -MCP-HVPIPE-001 to -021 and 21 mappings were created\",\n    \"2026-10-16 16:32:30 to 16:37:30 local, status pending, read back with 0\",\n    \"mismatches; sections 1, 19, 19.3, and 20.1 record it.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Lint PASSED (112 acceptance criteria, 7 standing rules); 94 diagrams render\",\n    \"headless, 0 failures, 0 font conflicts, none over 2 pages.\",\n    \"Status: proposed, not approved, not hostile-validated.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Signed: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh@ClaudeCode | Confidence: correctness 95%, accuracy 95%, completeness 95%\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\n    \"Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QPEG9wEPfbfj4qgB3eeK2N\",\n    \"\\u0000\",\n    \"9fd6b653b