st if the foundation's Phase B ships its manual\",\n82:     \"hostile reviews before A-06 retires them.\",\n83:     \"\",\n84:     \"- A-11: the migration that adds HvState and HvRequestId sets Final (with\",\n85:     \"  no request id) on every turn whose hostile review is Pass or Fail.\",\n86:     \"- Section 7.4 and section 12 state it; HvAdmissionEligibility names the\",\n87:     \"  null request id of such a turn; HvStorageSchema owns the rule.\",\n88:     \"- FR-MCP-HVPIPE-012-AC007 (MigrationMarksHvReviewedTurnsFinalThreeProviders,\",\n89:     \"  three providers); 19.2 maps S-07 to it. FR, TR, and TEST-MCP-HVPIPE-012\",\n90:     \"  updated in the store in one atomic updateBatch; all 63 records equal\",\n91:     \"  section 19.1 (2026-10-17T08:55:01 local).\",\n92:     \"\",\n93:     \"Lint PASSED at 2026-10-17T08:54:21 local (114 acceptance criteria).\",\n94:     \"Status: proposed, not approved, not hostile-validated.\",\n95:     \"\",\n96:     \"Signed: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh@ClaudeCode | Confidence: correctness 94%, accuracy 95%, completeness 94%\",\n97:     \"\",\n98:     \"Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\n99:     \"Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QPEG9wEPfbfj4qgB3eeK2N\",\n100:     \"\\u0000\",\n101:     \"31904493381cfef56c57790950e23e72f3ecc39b\\u0000docs(architecture): amendment 1, pre-HV holistic review fixes and AC011\",\n102:     \"\",\n103:     \"Holistic read of the whole amendment before the hostile validation (profile\",\n104:     \"7.5), with what-if and propagation checks. Implementer fixes:\",\n105:     \"\",\n106:     \"- A-02 cited section 20.4 for the rule that the pipeline does not validate\",\n107:     \"  its own plan; the rule is in section 20.3.\",\n108:     \"- Section 7.3 still read \\\"not the submitter\\\" after D-05; eligibility now\",\n109:     \"  names the author too, as R-08, I-07, and HvReviewerEligibility do.\",\n110:     \"- I-06 described the log hash as the SHA-2