next poll); 503 `audit_unavailable`.\n944: \n945: ```mermaid\n946: flowchart TD\n947:     S([\"ClaimHvRunCommand: workerId\"]) --> SW[[\"SerializableWrite with AuditLedgerGuard\"]]\n948:     SW -->|\"audit unavailable\"| E1([\"503 audit_unavailable\"])\n949:     SW -->|\"attempts exhausted\"| E2([\"409 conflict, retryable true\"])\n950:     SW -->|attempt| P{\"An enabled reviewer with a requested probe and free capacity?\"}\n951:     P -->|yes| PR[\"Insert the Probe run with a fresh nonce; clear ProbeRequestedUtc\"]\n952:     PR --> L1[[\"FencedLease Claim\"]]\n953:     L1 --> R1([\"probe claim\"])\n954:     P -->|no| Q{\"Oldest Queued request whose assignee is eligible with capacity?\"}\n955:     Q -->|yes| RV\n956:     Q -->|\"no, assignee no longer eligible\"| RR[[\"Policy RoundRobinAssignment\"]]\n957:     RR -->|\"no eligible reviewer with capacity\"| NX{\"Another Queued request?\"}\n958:     NX -->|yes| Q\n959:     NX -->|no| R0([\"null: nothing claimable\"])\n960:     RR -->|\"reviewer, reassignment recorded\"| RV[\"Insert the Review run, attempt AttemptCount plus 1\"]\n961:     Q -->|\"no Queued request\"| R0\n962:     RV --> L2[[\"FencedLease Claim\"]]\n963:     L2 --> RS[\"Request Running, AttemptCount plus 1, StartedUtc on the first attempt\"]\n964:     RS --> N[[\"NotificationOutbox: hv_started\"]]\n965:     N --> R2([\"review claim\"])\n966: ```\n967: \n968: #### RecordHvRunHeartbeatCommand: renew the lease and read cancellation [FR-MCP-HVPIPE-007, -008]\n969: \n970: - Handler: `RecordHvRunHeartbeatCommand(string WorkspacePath, string RunId, string WorkerId, long FenceToken) : ICommand<HvHeartbeatResult>`; `HvHeartbeatResult { leaseExpiresUtc, cancelRequested }`.\n971: - Delegate: AuditLedgerGuard; FencedLease `Renew`; `LastHeartbeatUtc`; `cancelRequested` is true when the request is `CancelRequested` (a probe run is never canceled this way).\n972: - Results: renewed; `stale_fence` (the worker stops its process, section 16.2); 409 `conflict` (`retryable