e request's state is unchanged (`ResponseTransitionClosesHvItemOnly`).\n2428:   - AC004 Given the public model-grade route and tool of the foundation, when the surfaces are scanned, then neither exists (`ModelGradeHasNoPublicSurface`).\n2429: \n2430: ### 19.2 Settled requirements to the catalog\n2431: \n2432: - S-01 FR-001 to FR-021 (the pipeline). S-02 FR-001, FR-020. S-03 FR-004, FR-010, FR-012. S-04 foundation Phase B (unchanged), FR-012. S-05 section 1. S-06 FR-012, FR-005. S-07 FR-012, FR-012-AC007. S-08 superseded by S-28. S-09 FR-004-AC005. S-10 FR-010-AC001, -AC004. S-11 FR-004-AC001. S-12 R-21 (the foundation's Stop-gate remedy; not an HV input). S-13 FR-010, FR-011, FR-015. S-14 FR-006. S-15 FR-003, FR-009. S-16 FR-005-AC003, -AC004. S-17 FR-002. S-18 FR-008, FR-015, FR-016. S-19 FR-017. S-20 FR-005-AC006, FR-012. S-21 FR-010-AC001, FR-015-AC001. S-22 FR-008-AC001 to -AC003, FR-016. S-23 FR-012-AC001. S-24 FR-007-AC001. S-25 FR-014. S-26 FR-009-AC002, -AC003. S-27 FR-003. S-28 FR-013. S-29 FR-018, FR-019. S-30 FR-011. S-31 section 20 (the implementation worktree). S-32 sections 19 and 20 (H0). S-33 section 20 (BDPv4).\n2433: - P-01 FR-002, V-5. P-02 FR-008-AC004, -AC011. P-03 FR-016-AC002. P-04 FR-003, V-7. P-05 FR-010-AC003. P-06 V-6, R-24. P-07 FR-002-AC008, V-5.\n2434: - The handoff's adversarial coverage list: alias exclusion FR-002-AC002; round-robin persistence FR-002-AC005; snapshot consistency FR-004-AC004, FR-012-AC005; stale-worker rejection FR-007-AC004; cancellation and finalization races FR-008-AC006; evidence completeness FR-011-AC002; lossless GZIP round trips FR-011-AC001; corrupt or truncated input FR-011-AC002; audit failures FR-018-AC002, -AC004; separate per-turn and holistic outputs FR-010-AC001; indefinite retention FR-019-AC001; no permanent raw duplicate FR-011-AC001; streaming FR-008-AC003, FR-016-AC001; immutable results and turns FR-012-AC002; remediation as new work FR-005-AC001 and UC-HV-12; self-review variance FR-013; no TODO