32 remediation on 2026-07-07.\",\"Current inventory originally found 206 suppression or warning bypass entries.\",\"Only CA1416, CA1819, and current CA2227 cases are approved for suppression so far.\",\"CS8632 is complete. Nullable annotations are enabled in every project and CS8632 NoWarn entries were removed.\",\"All other diagnostics and warning bypasses must be resolved by fixing code, project configuration, package metadata, or dependency versions.\",\"CA1308 requires invariant case insensitive comparison instead of case normalization.\"],\"technicalDetails\":[\"Acceptance criteria\",\"Solution build remains zero warnings and zero errors.\",\"Only CA1416, CA1819, and current CA2227 cases are approved for suppression at this point.\",\"Every other diagnostic and warning bypass must be resolved by fixing code, project configuration, package metadata, or dependency versions.\",\"Temporary suppressions include owner and review condition only if explicitly approved later.\",\"New unapproved suppressions fail repo validation.\",\"No broad warning bypass remains unless explicitly approved.\",\"CS8632 remediation completed on 2026-07-07. There are zero CS8632 project references, every csproj has explicit nullable enabled, and CS8632 NoWarn entries were removed.\",\"CS8632 nullable enable exposed NUKE build nullable and field initialization warnings. Those were fixed in build code instead of suppressed.\",\"Validation after CS8632 remediation dotnet build QBrainAi.sln -c Debug -v minimal passed with 0 warnings and 0 errors.\",\"Validation after CS8632 remediation dotnet test tests/Build.Tests/Build.Tests.csproj -c Debug --no-restore -v minimal passed 105 tests, 0 failed, 0 skipped.\",\"Approval worksheet follows. Counts are original diagnostic occurrences unless marked complete. One suppression entry can contain multiple diagnostics.\",\"CA1416 suppression is approved by user on 2026-07-07.\",\"CA1819 suppression is approved by user on 2026-07-07.\",\"CA2227 suppression is approved after case analysis on 2026-07-07. Current sites are non-observable DTO, options binding, YAML model, or EF navigation collections. Future observable collection properties should repopulate existing instances instead of replacing them.\",\"CA1308 suppression is rejected by user on 2026-07-07 and must be fixed with invariant case insensitive comparison.\",\"Worksheet item 612 means Compiler obsolete member warning without custom message, count 106, mechanisms PragmaDisable, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Replace obsolete API usage or regenerate code so obsolete members are not referenced.\",\"Worksheet item 618 means Compiler obsolete member warning with custom message, count 106, mechanisms PragmaDisable, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Replace obsolete API usage according to the obsolete message or regenerate generated code without obsolete calls.\",\"Worksheet item ASP0019 means Header dictionary Add usage should use Append or indexer semantics, count 2, mechanisms NoWarn, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Replace header Add calls with Append or indexer semantics as appropriate.\",\"Worksheet item CA1002 means Do not expose generic lists in public contracts, count 12, mechanisms PragmaDisable and SuppressMessage, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Prefer IReadOnlyList, ICollection, or contract-specific DTO shape unless a later explicit approval is granted.\",\"Worksheet item CA1031 means Do not catch general exception types, count 7, mechanisms NoWarn and PragmaDisable, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Catch specific exception types or split expected failure handling from unexpected failure handling.\",\"Worksheet item CA1054 means URI like parameters should not be strings, count 6, mechanisms NoWarn and PragmaDisable, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Use Uri parameters or rename values that are not URIs.\",\"Worksheet item CA1055 means URI return values should not be strings, count 2, mechanisms PragmaDisable, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Return Uri or rename values that are not URIs.\",\"Worksheet item CA1056 means URI properties should not be strings, count 4, mechanisms NoWarn, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Use Uri properties or rename values that are not URIs.\",\"Worksheet item CA1062 means Validate arguments of public methods, count 4, mechanisms SuppressMessage, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Add explicit argument validation for public methods.\",\"Worksheet item CA1308 means Normalize strings to uppercase, count 3, mechanisms PragmaDisable and SuppressMessage, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Use invariant case insensitive comparison instead of case normalization.\",\"Worksheet item CA1416 means Validate platform compatibility for platform specific APIs, count 6, mechanisms PragmaDisable, decision approved for suppression, remediation Keep approved suppression and document scope in approval register.\",\"Worksheet item CA1515 means Consider making public types internal, count 9, mechanisms NoWarn, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Make types internal where not part of public contract or document explicit future approval request.\",\"Worksheet item CA1812 means Avoid uninstantiated internal classes, count 1, mechanisms SuppressMessage, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Remove dead type, instantiate through DI, or make usage visible to analyzer without suppression.\",\"Worksheet item CA1819 means Properties should not return arrays, count 1, mechanisms SuppressMessage, decision approved for suppression, remediation Keep approved suppression and document scope in approval register.\",\"Worksheet item CA1848 means Use LoggerMessage delegates for high performance logging, count 1, mechanisms EditorConfigDisabledDiagnostic, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Replace hot path logger extension calls with LoggerMessage source-generated or delegate logging and remove editorconfig disable.\",\"Worksheet item CA1849 means Call async methods when in an async method, count 6, mechanisms NoWarn, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Use async API variants in async methods or justify synchronous boundary with explicit future approval.\",\"Worksheet item CA1861 means Avoid constant arrays as arguments, count 1, mechanisms SuppressMessage, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Hoist repeated constant arrays to static readonly storage.\",\"Worksheet item CA2000 means Dispose objects before losing scope, count 1, mechanisms PragmaDisable, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Fix ownership or disposal flow so disposable instances are disposed correctly.\",\"Worksheet item CA2227 means Collection properties should be read only, count 24, mechanisms PragmaDisable and SuppressMessage, decision approved for suppression, remediation Keep current approved suppressions. For future observable collections, preserve instance and repopulate values.\",\"Worksheet item CA3003 means Review code for file path injection vulnerabilities, count 4, mechanisms NoWarn, decision must be fixed and suppression removed unless explicitly approved later, remediation Validate, no