ocat\\\", repo=\\\"Hello-World\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t- Find issues across the user's top repositories: query=\\\"memory leak\\\"\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tIf no repository is specified, searches across the user's top repositories. For more targeted results, specify a specific repository.\\n\\t\\t\",\nsrc/QBrainAi.Support.Mcp/graphrag-global/input/canonical/docs/context/todo-schema.md:New-McpTodo -Id \"ISSUE-NEW\" -Title \"Capture sync regression\" -Section \"issues\" -Priority high\r\nsrc/QBrainAi.Support.Mcp/graphrag-global/input/canonical/docs/context/todo-schema.md:mcp_todo_create \"ISSUE-NEW\" \"Capture sync regression\" \"issues\" \"high\" '{}'\r\nsrc/QBrainAi.Support.Mcp/graphrag-global/input/canonical/AGENTS.md:5. Capture rich turn detail: interpretation, response, status, actions (type/status/filePath), contextList, filesModified, designDecisions, requirementsDiscovered, blockers, and relevant processing dialog.\r\nsrc/QBrainAi.Support.Mcp/graphrag-global/input/canonical/AGENTS.md:3. Capture requirements as they emerge. Do not defer to later.\r\nsrc/QBrainAi.Support.Mcp/appsettings.yaml:  WebsiteRequestTimeoutSeconds: 120\r\ntests/Validation.Shared/ValidationAuth.cs:                process.Kill(entireProcessTree: true);\nsrc/QBrainAi.Support.Mcp/Services/TransactionGatedToolRegistryService.cs:                    ? await CaptureToolAsync(result.Tool.Id, cancellationToken).ConfigureAwait(false)\nsrc/QBrainAi.Support.Mcp/Services/TransactionGatedToolRegistryService.cs:                var before = await CaptureToolAsync(id, cancellationToken).ConfigureAwait(false);\nsrc/QBrainAi.Support.Mcp/Services/TransactionGatedToolRegistryService.cs:                var before = await CaptureToolAsync(id, cancellationToken).ConfigureAwait(false);\nsrc/QBrainAi.Support.Mcp/Services/TransactionGatedToolRegistryService.cs:    private async Task<ToolDefinitionSnapshot?> CaptureToolAsync(int id, CancellationToken cancellationToken)\nsrc/QBrainAi.Support.Mcp/Services/TransactionGatedTool