hin length?\"}\n865:     V -->|no| E1([\"400 validation_error, details.field\"])\n866:     V -->|yes| SW[[\"SerializableWrite with AuditLedgerGuard\"]]\n867:     SW -->|\"audit unavailable\"| E2([\"503 audit_unavailable\"])\n868:     SW -->|\"attempts exhausted\"| E3([\"409 conflict, retryable true\"])\n869:     SW -->|attempt| F{\"Request in the workspace?\"}\n870:     F -->|no| E4([\"404 not_found, details.resource hv_request\"])\n871:     F -->|yes| T{\"Completed, Failed, or Canceled?\"}\n872:     T -->|no| E5([\"409 hv_request_active, details.status\"])\n873:     T -->|yes| RM[\"Null every evidence and chunk payload still present; stamp RemovedUtc, RemovedBy, RemovalReason\"]\n874:     RM --> R([\"200 RemoveHvEvidenceResult: removed kinds and chunk count, empty on a repeat\"])\n875: ```\n876: \n877: #### StreamHvRunOutputQuery: attach to the live output of any HV [FR-MCP-HVPIPE-016]\n878: \n879: - Handler: `StreamHvRunOutputQuery(string WorkspacePath, string HvRequestId, string? LastEventId) : IQuery<IAsyncEnumerable<HvOutputEvent>>`, served by the controller as `text/event-stream` (S-18, S-22).\n880: - Order: the request (404); AuditLedgerGuard `RecordRead` once per connection; then OrderedEventReplay over the request's runs in attempt order and each run's chunks in sequence order (section 13.5), ending when the request is terminal and every chunk has been sent.\n881: - Errors (before the stream starts): 400 `validation_error` (`workspacePath`, `Last-Event-ID`); 404 `not_found` (`hv_request`); 503 `audit_unavailable`.\n882: \n883: ```mermaid\n884: flowchart TD\n885:     S([\"Handler runs: GET requests/{hvRequestId}/output/stream\"]) --> F{\"Request in the workspace?\"}\n886:     F -->|no| E1([\"404 not_found, details.resource hv_request\"])\n887:     F -->|yes| A[[\"AuditLedgerGuard RecordRead\"]]\n888:     A -->|\"audit unavailable\"| E2([\"503 audit_unavailable\"])\n889:     A -->|recorded| OR[[\"OrderedEventReplay: runs in attempt order, chunks in sequence\"]]\n890:     OR -->|\"malformed Last-Event-ID\"| E3([\"400 validation_error, details.field Last-Event-ID\"])\n891:     OR -->|\"request terminal, all sent\"| END([\"stream ended after hv_run_closed\"])\n892:     OR -->|\"caller disconnected\"| END2([\"stream closed\"])\n893: ```\n894: \n895: #### StreamHvNotificationsQuery: the HV notification stream [FR-MCP-HVPIPE-017]\n896: \n897: - Handler: `StreamHvNotificationsQuery(string WorkspacePath, string? LastEventId) : IQuery<IAsyncEnumerable<HvNotificationDto>>`, served as `text/event-stream` (S-19, R-16). Notifications carry ids and verdicts, not evidence, so no read row is recorded.\n898: - Errors (before the stream starts): 400 `validation_error` (`workspacePath`, `Last-Event-ID`).\n899: \n900: ```mermaid\n901: flowchart TD\n902:     S([\"Handler runs: GET notifications/stream\"]) --> OR[[\"OrderedEventReplay: HvNotification rows by sequence\"]]\n903:     OR -->|\"malformed Last-Event-ID\"| E([\"400 validation_error, details.field Last-Event-ID\"])\n904:     OR -->|\"caller disconnected\"| END([\"stream closed\"])\n905: ```\n906: \n907: #### QueryHvNotificationsQuery: poll notifications [FR-MCP-HVPIPE-017]\n908: \n909: - Handler: `QueryHvNotificationsQuery(string WorkspacePath, HvNotificationQuery Query) : IQuery<HvNotificationPage>`: rows with `Sequence` greater than `afterSequence` (at least 0), at most `limit` (1..1000, default 100), in sequence order, with the workspace's `lastSequence`.\n910: - Errors: 400 `validation_error` (`workspacePath`, `afterSequence`, `limit`).\n911: \n912: ```mermaid\n913: flowchart TD\n914:     S([\"Handler runs: GET notifications\"]) --> V{\"afterSequence at least 0, limit 1 to 1000?\"}\n915:     V -->|no| E([\"400 validation_error, details.field\"])\n916:     V -->|yes| Q[\"Read rows after afterSequence in sequence order, up to limit; read lastSequence\"]\n917:     Q --> R([\"200 items and lastSequence\"])\nEXIT_CODE=0\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
